Dear {{name}},

I follow {{outlet}}'s work and your editorial quality is clear.

A small team can't keep up with the daily content volume Google News ranking needs.

I run an automated news engine that publishes sourced, SEO-ready articles in your brand, 24/7 — every article human-approved before it goes live. It's live and running now.

Open to a 15-minute call to see it on {{outlet}}'s topics? If it's not up to your standard, I'll take the feedback.{{unsubscribe}}

